# gunk self-analysis ignore rules.
#
# When gunk decomposes its OWN repository, the engine's synthetic test
# fixtures (deliberately fake SaaS apps: Stripe checkout, OAuth login,
# SendGrid email, order APIs, etc.) look exactly like real capabilities,
# so the pipeline surfaces them as modules that aren't part of gunk's
# actual product. They are test scaffolding, not first-party source —
# exclude the whole fixture tree.
engine/test/fixtures/

# Eval/replay tapes and golden files live alongside the fixtures and are
# data, not code worth decomposing.
engine/test/

# Marketing/site and generated docs are not extractable product modules.
web/
